<QuestionLayout
  title="How do I author a Traverse capability in plain English?"
  description="Load traverse-capability-author: interview → registry check → contract → WASM → human-reviewed PR. Under the hood still Rust→WASM. Manual Rust is secondary."
  canonical="https://traverse-framework.com/questions/how-do-i-author-a-capability-in-plain-english.html"
  category="Getting started"
